[{"n":"Lore","a":"Yharnam, the Church, the Great Ones, and what we know (and only guess).","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/"},{"n":"Timeline","a":"From the underground civilization to the Night of the Hunt, in rebuilt order.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/"},{"n":"Areas","a":"From the Hunter's Dream to the Astral Clocktower: the whole map.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/"},{"n":"Characters","a":"Who you meet in the streets, windows and nightmares.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/"},{"n":"Bosses","a":"The bosses, with weaknesses and a tip for each.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/bosses/"},{"n":"Weapons","a":"Trick weapons and firearms, filterable by type and scaling.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/weapons/"},{"n":"Tools","a":"Vials, bombs, poisons and whatever else fits your belt.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/tools/"},{"n":"Builds","a":"Six paths: attributes by level, weapons, runes, gems and a guide video.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/builds/"},{"n":"Attributes","a":"Levels, Insight, frenzy and how each point weighs.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/attributes/"},{"n":"Chalices","a":"The optional labyrinths: types, rituals and glyphs.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/chalices/"},{"n":"Runes","a":"Caryll Runes by group, with effect and where to find them.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/runes/"},{"n":"Blood Gems","a":"Effects and shapes of the gems that go on the blade.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/gems/"},{"n":"Endings","a":"Three endings and what each choice costs.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/endings/"},{"n":"Gallery","a":"29 videos, with thumbnails and a click-to-play player.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/gallery/"},{"n":"Sources & method","a":"Where each fact came from, and what still needs checking.","k":"Section","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/about/"},{"n":"Yharnam","a":"A gothic valley city known for blood-based medicine. It hosts the Healing Church, which offers blood transfusion as a miracle cure. A plague of beasts afflicts ","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#yharnam"},{"n":"The Healing Church","a":"A religious order that found, through ancient blood, a cure for disease. It grew through hospitals and hunters. Its core hid blood research: witches, vicars, ex","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#igreja-cura"},{"n":"The Pthumerians","a":"An ancient people whose underground civilization left the Labyrinths (Chalices). They reached knowledge of the Great Ones before vanishing; their rites are the ","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#pthumerianos"},{"n":"The Great Ones","a":"Cosmic entities above humanity. Some are worshipped, others are imprisoned. They are the source of Insight: knowing too much is a burden.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#grandes-seres"},{"n":"Byrgenwerth","a":"A college of scholars (Master Willem, Laurence, Micolash, Caryll) researching the occult. The quest to contact the Great Ones splits them.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#byrgenwerth"},{"n":"The Hunt and the Night","a":"A recurring hunt ritual: hunters fight beasts as the city bleeds. The protagonist arrives for a transfusion. The Hunter's Dream is a refuge.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#caçada"},{"n":"The Hunter's Dream","a":"A dream plane run by Gehrman and the Moon Presence. Workshop, resting place and prison. Can be read as a way of keeping hunters apart.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#sonho"},{"n":"The Beast Scourge","a":"After many transfusions the old blood turns people into beasts: fur, claws, loss of reason. The Church tried to suppress it.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#bestas"},{"n":"Insight and the Inner Eyes","a":"More knowledge lets you see what is hidden. Every point reveals more. Knowledge has a cost.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#olhos"},{"n":"Kos and Kosm","a":"Kos(m) is a Great One tied to the sea and the Fishing Hamlet. Its 'child', the Orphan, suggests a hunt for a substitute child.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#kos-kosm"},{"n":"Nightmares","a":"Planes that overlay the world: Nightmare of Mensis, Hunter's Nightmare, Nightmare Frontier. Each is the work of a particular wish.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#pesadelos"},{"n":"Cainhurst and the Vilebloods","a":"A castle of isolated nobility tied to Queen Annalise and blood rites; contrasts with the public Church.","k":"Lore","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/lore/#cainhurst"},{"n":"The Pthumerians","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e1"},{"n":"Discovery of the old blood","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e2"},{"n":"Byrgenwerth","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e3"},{"n":"The split","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e4"},{"n":"The Healing Church and the Workshop","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e5"},{"n":"The Beast Scourge","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e6"},{"n":"The Night of the Hunt","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e7"},{"n":"The hunter's arrival","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e8"},{"n":"The Dream and the end","k":"Timeline","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/timeline/#e9"},{"n":"Hunter's Dream","a":"A dream refuge with the Workshop, the garden and the Doll.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#hunters-dream"},{"n":"Central Yharnam","a":"Opening streets with mobs, the Cleric Beast on the bridge and Gascoigne.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#central-yharnam"},{"n":"Cathedral Ward","a":"A district tied to the Healing Church, with Vicar Amelia.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#cathedral-ward"},{"n":"Old Yharnam","a":"A burnt, abandoned district housing the Blood-Starved Beast and Djura. Optional, but tied to chalice","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#old-yharnam"},{"n":"Upper Cathedral Ward","a":"Heights where Ebrietas, a Great One, lives, and the Celestial Emissary's Lumenflower Gardens.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#upper-cathedral-ward"},{"n":"Hemwick Charnel Lane","a":"A grave-digger and witch district with the Witch of Hemwick.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#hemwick"},{"n":"Forbidden Woods","a":"Dense forest with the Shadow of Yharnam; leads to Byrgenwerth.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#forbidden-woods"},{"n":"Byrgenwerth","a":"Ruined college; Rom guards the forbidden knowledge.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#byrgenwerth"},{"n":"Yahar'gul, Unseen Village","a":"A hidden village seating a secret cult; The One Reborn waits in Advent Plaza, the required way to th","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#yahargul"},{"n":"Nightmare Frontier","a":"Nightmare region home to Amygdala, reached by being abducted by a Lesser Amygdala.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#nightmare-frontier"},{"n":"Nightmare of Mensis","a":"Nightmare built by Micolash; home of Mergo's Wet Nurse.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#nightmare-mensis"},{"n":"Hypogean Gaol","a":"An underground gaol with Darkbeast Paarl, tied to Djura.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#hypogean-gaol"},{"n":"Cainhurst Castle","a":"Castle of ice and blood of the Vilebloods; the Forsaken Cainhurst Castle on the roof holds Martyr Lo","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#cainhurst"},{"n":"Lecture Building","a":"Study building of Byrgenwerth, on the way to Rom.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#research-hall"},{"n":"Fishing Hamlet","a":"DLC fishing village where Orphan of Kos waits.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#fishing-hamlet"},{"n":"Hunter's Nightmare","a":"Nightmare of the original hunters: Ludwig, Laurence.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#hunters-nightmare"},{"n":"Astral Clocktower","a":"Lady Maria's clocktower.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#astral-clocktower"},{"n":"Chalice Dungeons","a":"Procedural labyrinths of the Pthumeru ruins. See Chalices.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#chalice-dungeons"},{"n":"Research Hall","a":"Research building inside the DLC Hunter's Nightmare.","k":"Areas","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/areas/#research-hall-dlc"},{"n":"The Doll","a":"Dream's helper","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#boneca"},{"n":"Gehrman, the First Hunter","a":"Mentor and jailer","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#gehrman"},{"n":"Eileen the Crow","a":"Hunter of hunters","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#eileen"},{"n":"Alfred","a":"Hunter and guide","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#alfred"},{"n":"Djura","a":"Defender of the oppressed","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#djura"},{"n":"Father Gascoigne","a":"Transformed hunter","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#gascoigne"},{"n":"Henryk","a":"Eileen's hunter","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#henryk"},{"n":"Valtr","a":"Leader of The League","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#valtr"},{"n":"Iosefka","a":"Physician","k":"Characters","u":"/projetos/arquivo-de-yharnam/en/characters/#iosefka"},{"n